BT /F3 7.8 Tf 50.00 169.19 Td (   - Translation 1-Euro: minCutoff=1.35Hz, beta=38.0, dCutoff=2.8Hz, highVelBeta=1800 \(thresh=0.04m/s\)) Tj ET
